    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu",
        "text": "Sauin is supposed to be about shepherding spirits into the afterlife. Our society has totally corrupted it with consumerism. Respectfully, I will abstain."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu",
        "text": "Not to mention, I don't get paid that much. I need to get my grades up and nab a scholarship."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_272_strong_1",
            "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jaye",
        "text": "Yeah, that sounds about right for you..."
